<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - two firms upgrade Intel.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - two firms upgrade Intel.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown said it upgraded Intel Corp to strong buy from buy.</p>
<p>-- also, Smith Barney raised its rating on the stock to buy from outperform, according to a Smith Barney source.</p>
